
title: NPC_Red
---
<<declare $lowOnTime = false>>

<<if $lowOnTime>>
    <<jump LowOnTime>>
<<elseif visited("RedIntro")>>
    <<jump RedWelcomeBack>>
<<else>>
    <<jump RedIntro>>
<<endif>>
===

title: RedIntro
---
    Red: Welcome to the game, press space to jump and WASD to move
===
title: RedWelcomeBack
---
    Red: You can also press shift to slam to the ground!
    Red: You only have a certain amount of time to complete the level!
===
title: LowOnTime
---
    Red: Hurry up, you are almost out of time!
===